{"steam_appid":4090330,"steam_name":"Mall Rivals","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4090330/260617266/410398c56020ede69a15a757244350f88778b14b/1787320722/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1787851349","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257365967/d05843f7e2cd5303995a3af4923177bb24336801/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1787851349","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/3c79227f6908027b2bab997657569af9c186927b/ss_3c79227f6908027b2bab997657569af9c186927b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787881949","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/99ead0ac2bda373f96e398cee6d2d9228f879502/ss_99ead0ac2bda373f96e398cee6d2d9228f879502.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787881949","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/2bb7e86101315d067993b5088c353be9375dacf6/ss_2bb7e86101315d067993b5088c353be9375dacf6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787881949","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/761b8409ebc9a03593e335d7e0219eee075ed5a6/ss_761b8409ebc9a03593e335d7e0219eee075ed5a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787881949","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/2b79ba1166ddf601fab0afc5c01b2d3c30388514/ss_2b79ba1166ddf601fab0afc5c01b2d3c30388514.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787881949"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your own shop, hire employees, and compete with up to 8 players in a chaotic mall where success comes from smart business decisions or cunning sabotage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/c2153d58b43e505691441484aaf8ca98.avif?t=1787881949\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras_big/c2153d58b43e505691441484aaf8ca98.webp?t=1787881949 width=1560 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick the store that fits you best, decorate it however you want, fill your shelves and stock up your shop, your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/2e2359368661960985cf319b96d07092.poster.avif?t=1787881949\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/2e2359368661960985cf319b96d07092.webm?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/2e2359368661960985cf319b96d07092.mp4?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/8e28d1ff7f16ff36e35a6f29f259d4b0.avif?t=1787881949\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras_big/8e28d1ff7f16ff36e35a6f29f259d4b0.webp?t=1787881949 width=1560 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Up to 8 players in the same mall fighting for the same customers. Undercut prices, steal strategies, or take a shadier route sabotage is always an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/773d034246e63abeec9108f84d118091.poster.avif?t=1787881949\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/773d034246e63abeec9108f84d118091.webm?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/773d034246e63abeec9108f84d118091.mp4?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/3a9041ac08565bd2583a4d13b91e676b.avif?t=1787881949\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras_big/3a9041ac08565bd2583a4d13b91e676b.webp?t=1787881949 width=1560 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Head to the board room, propose new policies, and vote with other players. Smart proposals can give you the edge or mess things up for everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/0d0c26748b8d451fe5fbc0c1f88d3c0f.poster.avif?t=1787881949\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/0d0c26748b8d451fe5fbc0c1f88d3c0f.webm?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/0d0c26748b8d451fe5fbc0c1f88d3c0f.mp4?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/26a6d41b063a4638bc95e067f6f45c46.avif?t=1787881949\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras_big/26a6d41b063a4638bc95e067f6f45c46.webp?t=1787881949 width=1560 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Broke the rules and got caught? Your face goes on ShameTV for everyone to see. Risk it or play it safe your call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/f029178cfe2152049f8dd50a8ee9d85d.poster.avif?t=1787881949\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/f029178cfe2152049f8dd50a8ee9d85d.webm?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/f029178cfe2152049f8dd50a8ee9d85d.mp4?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/608a63745eabf898f85febceb90f74e9.avif?t=1787881949\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras_big/608a63745eabf898f85febceb90f74e9.webp?t=1787881949 width=1560 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hire employees who will support you on your rise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/0835bc1bec3d8b47b83f457c6bc28a18.poster.avif?t=1787881949\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/0835bc1bec3d8b47b83f457c6bc28a18.webm?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/0835bc1bec3d8b47b83f457c6bc28a18.mp4?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/67641d4fe353794424f274ecf1589b3f.avif?t=1787881949\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras_big/67641d4fe353794424f274ecf1589b3f.webp?t=1787881949 width=1560 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your character and bring your style into the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/a16c485e43488c4e59107b9306afbe2a.poster.avif?t=1787881949\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/a16c485e43488c4e59107b9306afbe2a.webm?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/a16c485e43488c4e59107b9306afbe2a.mp4?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/6d88b97ab3df205388bf843ea5d3376a.avif?t=1787881949\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras_big/6d88b97ab3df205388bf843ea5d3376a.webp?t=1787881949 width=1560 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take a break from the hustle, enjoy yourself, and try your luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/2d08a05e179481868006f0f7a649c83c.poster.avif?t=1787881949\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/2d08a05e179481868006f0f7a649c83c.webm?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090330/extras/2d08a05e179481868006f0f7a649c83c.mp4?t=1787881949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060 / RX 6600 XT, 8 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Simulation"],"developers":["Creedon Games"],"publishers":["Creedon Games"],"release_date":"Aug 27, 2026"}